Package: homelab-webproxy
Architecture: all
Depends: perl (>= 5.36), libyaml-libyaml-perl, nginx, certbot, python3-certbot-nginx
Description: nginx + Let's Encrypt reverse proxy for the homelab-* ecosystem
 Ships homelab-webproxy-apply-sites, which reads an editable
 /etc/homelab/webproxy/sites.yml (domain -> upstream host:port pairs)
 and, for each site without an existing vhost yet, writes an nginx vhost
 and obtains a Let's Encrypt certificate via certbot's nginx plugin
 (which also upgrades the vhost to HTTPS-with-redirect and wires up
 renewal). Idempotent -- re-run after adding a new site to sites.yml;
 existing sites are left completely alone.
